OL,3,ACCTV shows frying pan used to stop
OL,4,Atrain attacker
OL,5,
OL,6,FCCTV footage of a crew member using a
OL,7,Ffrying pan to fend off a knifeman
OL,8,Faboard a train has been shown in court.
OL,10,FProsecutor Christopher Paxton KC said
OL,11,FSamir Zitouni showed "sheer courage and
OL,12,Fbravery in seeking to save lives and
OL,13,Fdefend others", during the mass
OL,14,Fstabbing on the Doncaster to London
OL,15,FKing's Cross train.
OL,17,FJurors at Cambridge Crown Court saw
OL,18,Ffootage of Zitouni using the pan
OL,19,Fagainst Anthony Williams, before the
OL,20,Ftrain made an unscheduled stop at
OL,21,FHuntingdon, Cambridgeshire, on 1
OL,22,FNovember 2025.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
