OL,3,ACCTV shows frying pan used to stop
OL,4,Atrain attacker
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilliams, 33, of Langford Road,
OL,7,FPeterborough, denies attempting to
OL,8,Fmurder 10 people aboard the train,
OL,9,Fthree people in Peterborough the day
OL,10,Fbefore and a boy at a London railway
OL,11,Fstation.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
