OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFlavio Bolsonaro calls himself 'leader
OL,4,Aof Brazil' after election loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the letter, Bolsonaro alleges,
OL,7,Fwithout offering evidence, that he was
OL,8,Fthe victim of "electoral fraud" and
OL,9,Fsays that he will lead the opposition
OL,10,Ffrom the US.
OL,12,FHe left Brazil on Tuesday after failing
OL,13,Fto comply with an order to surrender
OL,14,Fhis passports, a decision which Lula
OL,15,Fdescribed as "a shameful act".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
