OL,3,APhilippine police obtain warrant to
OL,4,Asearch Thomas Markle's devices
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour boxes of material, including
OL,7,Fcomputers, phones, hard drives and old
OL,8,Fvideotapes, were handed to police by
OL,9,FMeghan's half-brother, Thomas Markle
OL,10,FJr, last week. However, officers in
OL,11,FCebu needed a court warrant before they
OL,12,Fcould examine the items.
OL,14,FThomas Markle Sr, who is now in the US,
OL,15,Fhas strongly denied the allegations
OL,16,Fmade by his son, describing them as
OL,17,F"sick lies".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
